{"id": "53", "title": "池中金鳞", "author": "三界龙", "category": "玄幻魔法", "count": 5, "available": 5, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/0/53.htm", "intro": "金鳞岂是池中物!一遇风云便化龙！\r\n　　得风云，以问鼎天下！\r\n　　遇金鳞，则笑傲群雄！\r\n　　顺我者昌，逆我者亡！\r\n　　啸天一吼，天下震动！", "base": "files/article/html/0/53", "chapters": [{"title": "作品相关", "volume": true}, {"title": "凑字数,不用看", "file": "4502.html", "available": true}, {"title": "凑字数,不用看二", "file": "4507.html", "available": true}, {"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "001.天魂之玉", "file": "4770.html", "available": true}, {"title": "002.酒店小学生妹(空)", "file": "4771.html", "available": true}, {"title": "003.难缠的女人林薇(空)", "file": "4787.html", "available": true}]}